### v5 analysis

v5 regressed slightly vs v4 (Last -0.08, ImageNet -0.26). Higher replay_loss_weight diluted the relative contribution of L_zscl in the total gradient, hurting ImageNet retention. DTD forgetting improved (-2.13 → -1.33) but CIFAR100 forgetting worsened (-3.93 → -4.72). Net effect: wash. Replay weight was already well-balanced at 1.0.

